  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connect is a development program facilitating for mutual exchange for youths between 3 organizations: NMS (Det Norske Misjonsselskap), Movimento Encontr&#xE3;o and FLM (Fiangonana Loterana Malagasy). Connect has the main goal to raise young leaders that are influencing their societies in a positive way and that are working for a world without injustice and poverty. Important elements to reach this goal are to work for increased youth participation in the organizations, training of young leaders and work for an increased awareness of global challenges and being part of a global world. Norway; Madagascar, China, Brazil and South Africa</narrative>
  </description>
